 op:["HBIG and hepatitis B vaccine within 12 hours of birth","HBIG within 12 hours and hepatitis B vaccine when weight reaches 2,000 g","Hepatitis B vaccine alone within 12 hours","HBIG alone, then check HBsAg at 9 months","Defer all hepatitis B immunization until 1 month of age"],
